SAVANNA BREW CAFE WEBSITE
Introduction to Web Development

PROJECT DESCRIPTION:
A responsive five-page website for Savanna Brew Cafe,
located in Westlands, Nairobi.

PAGES:
1. index.html - Home
2. about.html - About Us
3. menu.html - Menu
4. gallery.html - Gallery
5. contact.html - Contact and Reservations

TECHNOLOGIES:
- HTML5
- CSS3
- Flexbox
- CSS Grid
- Responsive Media Queries

HOW TO RUN:
1. Extract the project folder.
2. Open the savanna-brew folder.
3. Double-click index.html.
4. Navigate through the website.

VALIDATION:
Validate HTML using:
https://validator.w3.org/

Validate CSS using:
https://jigsaw.w3.org/css-validator/

Record any remaining warnings after validation.

